1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,969
One hot dog, please!

2
00:00:02,009 --> 00:00:03,688
Coming right up!

3
00:00:05,158 --> 00:00:07,177
...Are they fresh?

4
00:00:07,397 --> 00:00:10,163
Those have been rolling
since the Big Bang.

5
00:00:10,203 --> 00:00:12,080
...Are they good?

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,147
They're consistent.

7
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:15,788
Make it two!

8
00:00:16,608 --> 00:00:19,922
Now with thirteen billion years
of flavor!

9
00:00:19,962 --> 00:00:23,810
Thirteen billion years?
They need a break!

10
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,557
Rule one: never turn off
the roller.

11
00:00:30,477 --> 00:00:33,216
Did time just...
slow down?

12
00:00:33,256 --> 00:00:35,118
It does that.

13
00:00:35,938 --> 00:00:37,957
...Consistent.
